  "Note: “The roads are devastated by recent earthquakes, sometimes they end and start again from {0} meters away to the left or right side. You don’t have to backtrack here or any other location, this world goes on forever and you will encounter the same camp multiple times, so don’t worry about leaving them behind if you are not equipped enough to deal with them. Chose one direction north, south, east, or west at the start and follow it roughly, this way you don’t end up going in circles. Always keep the engine filled with oil and radiator with water, good luck.”": "纸条：“最近的地震把道路毁得一塌糊涂，有时路会突然中断，又在左侧或右侧 {0} 米外重新出现。你不必折返回这里或任何别的地方，这个世界无边无际，同样的营地你会遇到很多次，所以如果装备不够应付，就别担心把它们甩在身后。一开始就在北、南、东、西中选定一个方向，大致沿着它走，这样就不会原地兜圈子。发动机里要一直加满机油，散热器里要一直加满水。祝你好运。”",
