  "Permanent base mode disables far away item deletion (optimization), therefore making it possible to settle down and store items, cars in one place, use this option with map cheat, press \"Home\" button to mark home base on the map.\n\nWARNING: This can cause massive performance issues late game, due to far away items not being deleted. Use at own risk.": "永久基地模式会关闭远处物品的删除（性能优化），让你可以安顿下来，把物品和车辆存放在一处。请搭配地图作弊使用，按“Home”键在地图上标记基地。\n\n警告：由于远处物品不会被删除，游戏后期可能导致严重的性能问题。使用风险自负。",
  "Permanent base mode disables far away item deletion (optimization), therefore making it possible to settle down and store items, cars in one place, use this option with map cheat, press \"Home\" button to mark home base on the map.\n\nWARNING: This can cause massive performance issues, crashes late game, due to far away items not being deleted. Use at own risk.": "永久基地模式会关闭远处物品的删除（性能优化），让你可以安顿下来，把物品和车辆存放在一处。请搭配地图作弊使用，按“Home”键在地图上标记基地。\n\n警告：由于远处物品不会被删除，游戏后期可能导致严重的性能问题甚至崩溃。使用风险自负。",
